    {
      "id": "b2",
      "function": "problem",
      "scene_type": "gb_build",
      "spoken": "The data: the Kiel Canal links the North Sea at Brunsbüttel with the Baltic at Kiel. It is about 98.6 kilometres long, 162 metres wide at the surface and 11 metres deep, except on the eastern section.",
