      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b5",
      "function": "insight",
      "scene_type": "gb_calc",
      "spoken": "And the traffic? In 2024, 24,866 ships passed through. Divided by 366 days, as 2024 was a leap year, that is around 68 ships a day.",
